You can say so many loud words about this game, you can choose so many magnificent, not even afraid of this word - heroic - epithets, but even this will not be enough to describe the incredible experience that you live inside this masterpiece.

Left 4 Dead 2 is a masterpiece of the game industry. Art in its purest form;
An example for all the greedy corporations that have long forgotten (or maybe never knew) what it means to develop games with love..
